{"description":"Join us for our monthly Grok Bot meetup in Toronto at 800 Bay!\nWe'll still be giving away Cursor credits that you can use with Grok Bot as well.\nJoin us for an exciting night of learning all the different ways you can automate your life with Grok Bot. We'll be bringing in two amazing speakers and have some time for Q&A at the end.\nThe agenda for the night will be super chill. There will be dinner and drinks provided - come have fun!\n\n\n🗓️ Event Agenda\n5:30 - Mix and Mingle\n6:15 - Speaker 1\n6:30 - Speaker 2\n6:45 - Q&A\n7:00 - Networking and Building\n8:30 - Event Ends\nPrevious events: See here\nWant to help as a volunteer? Sign up here\nHosted by Neerav, Jia and Sukh. Volunteer Team: Joe, Dhanush, Kurt, Daniel, Gio, Ruhao, Monica, Mariia, Sahil, Shreya","organizer":"SpaceXAI for Toronto, Canada"}